    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45430" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐφραδ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>expressing oneself correctly</i> or
			<i>accurately</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				968.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				Ep.
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>
			<i>eloquently</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπνυμένα πάντ᾽ ἀγορεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.352
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>well-expressed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Mens.</u>
					4.64
				</span></i>
			, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.382
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), etc.</div>
